  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlomeeji bo ng'wa Yohana Matīīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'ītanò gwa būsugi bo ng'wa Kaisali Tibelio, ū nsugi wa Būyudaya walī Pontio Pilato. Ū ntemi wa Galilaya walī Helode, ū Filipo ū ng'wanong'wawe walī ntemi wa Itulea na Tulakonio; Lisania nang'hwe walī ntemi wa Abilene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīmo gwa būgabīji būtaale gwalī ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Anasi na Kayafa. Ū mu shikū jenījo ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu gūng'wizīīla Yohana, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zakalia, ū kū matogolo ūko wikalaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandya kūja akūlomeelaga pye a hose ū mu sī ja mbalama ya mongo gwa Yolodani. Walomeelaga ya būbatīījiwa kūlwa kūgalūka na kwingīla mu kūlekejiwa kwa shibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gīt'ūmo gwandīkilwe mu shitabo sha mihayo ya ng'hangi Isaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya henaho pye a banhū bakūbūbona ū būpīji bo ng'wa Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabita mataale ga banhū gakayiza ū kūlī Yohana kūbatījiwa, alīyo ūyūbahūgūla alībawīla gīkī, “Bing'we būbyīle wa shipīlī, nani wamuchagūlile gīkī mugūpeele ū nsango ūyo gūliza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, twajagi matwajo kūlwa koolecha būkaanīji bo kūgalūka kwing'we. Mutizandya kwiwīla gīkī, ‘Tūlī na nkūlūgenji wise Abulahamu.’ Nguno nalīmuwīla nūūlū kūfuma mu mawe gīt'aya, ū Mulungu adūgije kūmūkīja baana ū Abulahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ī haha īlīho mbasa ītūūlilwe ng'hana ng'hana a ha matina ga mitī. Hū kūhaya būlī ntī ūyo gūtūtwaja matwajo gawiza, gūkūbbutwa, gūponyiwe mu moto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a mabita ga banhū gūyūmūja galīhaya, “Ī gīsī lūūlū twīte ginehe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja ūbawīla gīkī, “Ūyo alī na ng'hanjo ibīlī ang'winhe ūyo atī nayo, nū yūyo alī na shilīwa īīte chene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batobisha ba goodi nabo biza ū kūlī we gīkī ababatīīje. Aho bamūja, “Nangi al'a bise twīte ginehe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Ng'ūshikīlīja ū kwīta īyo mulagīlilwe, gwike yaya ū kūkīlanīja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bashilikale būmūja gīkī, “A bise nise twīte ginehe?” Nang'hwe ūbashokeja, “Oyagi ū kūbiboneela a banhū, nū kūbalembekeja, nīyo muyūfujiwa nī mishahala ying'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū baalī balindīīla mu kwisagīlwa, kūnū bakwideedeng'hanyaga ū mung'holò jabo ūlū gīkī ū Yohana hū walī ng'wene ū Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei ng'wenekīlī ū Yohana akabashokeja pye a bose ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū nene ng'hana nalīmubatīīja na minzī, alīyo aliza ūyo anikīlile ū būdūla, ūyo natigeleelilwe ū nene nūūlū kūtaligūla matungījo ga shilatū shakwe; ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo akūmubatīīja na Moyo Ng'wela na moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūhūngo lokwe alī nalo mu nkono gokwe wei ng'wenekīlī, hama ū lūbūūga lokwe akūlūpyagūla alweje pe. Ū būsīga akūbūkuminga chiza abūtūūle ng'wiluuli lyakwe; alīyo a meela akūgapemba mu moto gūtī gwa kūjima!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo akabalomeela na kūbahūgūla a banhū mihayo mingī ya mbika na mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū ntemi Helode ūng'hūgūla kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Helodia ūyo walī nke wa ng'wanong'wawe, na kūlwa mihayo yīngī yīngī ī yabūbi īyo wīyītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Helode akamponya ū Yohana mu jeela, ūbiza ongeja gwabūbi gūngī a higūlya ya mibi ī yose!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbatījiwa kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūbatīījiwa pye a banhū, nū Yesu ūbatīījiwa; aho alīlomba, kūhayimanīla ī ligūlū lyalugūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyo Ng'wela wika alī mu mīlī gītī gwa ng'hūūlū izile a halī we; n'ilaka liza kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū līlīhaya gīkī, “Ū bebe ūlī Ng'wana wane Ntogwa, ūyo nakūyegelile hataale no.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwihela kwa shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho alandya kūtūmama walī na myaka gītī makūmi adatū, wiganikīlagwa gīkī olī ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosefu, ūyo olī ng'wana Eli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'witūnja o ng'wa Matati, o ng'wa Lawī, o ng'wa Meliki, o ng'wa Yanai, o ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ng'wa Matatia, o ng'wa Amosi, o ng'wa Naumu, o ng'wa Hesili, o ng'wa Nagai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ng'wa Maati, o ng'wa Matatia, o ng'wa Semei, o ng'wa Yosefu, o ng'wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ng'wa Yonani, o ng'wa Lesa, o ng'wa Zelubabeli, o ng'wa Salatieli, o ng'wa Neli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ng'wa Meliki, o ng'wa Adi, o ng'wa Kosamu, o ng'wa Elimadamu, o ng'wa Eli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ng'wa Yoshwa, o ng'wa Eliezeli, o ng'wa Yolimu, o ng'wa Matati, o ng'wa Lawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
